//! ============================================================================
//! ciel-keychaind - Keyring Manager & In-Memory State
//!
//! Orchestrates the in-memory hierarchy of collections and items:
//! - Thread-safe access to collections and item properties.
//! - Enforces lock status via [`LockManager`].
//! - Enforces authorization via [`PolicyEngine`].
//! - Handles PAM password-based unlock and disk persistence synchronization.
//!
//! ============================================================================

